+Reconstructs an RGBD image from a 2D latent map by sampling latent codes along camera rays and converting them into locally conditioned radiance fields. Sets itself apart by enabling generalizable neural rendering from arbitrary, unseen environments. Choose for generalizable rendering without per-scene optimization.
